                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "V5 · RECEIVER LANE — Aligned port layout, and the receiver claims row 1 on both sides. `poses` enters and leaves on one horizontal lane, so the mutation reads as a thread passing straight through the Block. Ordinary arguments start on row 2."
